  <div class="content-block">
    <div class="section-head">Site Structure</div>
    <ul class="summary-bullets">
      <li><strong>Meeting Summaries:</strong> The full meeting archive, organized by school year with filters by topic. Each meeting page includes AI-generated highlights, a votes table, timestamped transcript segments, and links to official materials.</li>
      <li><strong>Topics Index:</strong> Browse 36 recurring topics — from budget and reconfiguration to student policy and board governance — each with an evolving summary and a timeline of relevant meetings.</li>
      <li><strong>Data Status:</strong> An internal dashboard tracking which meetings have agendas, packets, minutes, video recordings, and processed transcripts.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="content-block">
