      <li><strong>Video recordings</strong> are published by SPC TV on <a href="https://vimeo.com/spctv" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vimeo</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>AI summaries and transcripts</strong> are generated from video auto-captions and may contain errors. Defer to official materials as the source of truth.</li>
